{"method":"session.event","params":{"sessionId":"{{sessionId}}","event":{"type":"user/message","seq":10,"time":0,"data":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\n技能是一组可复用的任务专用说明。本会话可用的技能如下：\n\n<available_skills>\n- `office`: Create or edit Office files; inspect Office files and PDFs. Load before rendering, conversion, or recalculation to enable office_render, office_convert, and office_recalculate next step.\n- `office-docx`: Create, read, edit, and validate Word documents (.docx).\n- `office-pptx`: Create, read, edit, and validate PowerPoint presentations (.pptx).\n- `office-xlsx`: Read, create, edit, and validate Excel workbooks, data, and formulas (.xlsx).\n</available_skills>\n\nIf the user names a skill, or the task clearly matches a skill's description, call the `skill` tool with the exact skill name before taking task actions. Load all applicable skills, then follow their full instructions. This catalog contains summaries only; do not infer or follow a skill's instructions until it has been loaded.\nA user may also invoke a skill directly; its <skill_content> block then appears in this conversation. Follow it, and do not call the `skill` tool again for that skill.\n</system-reminder>"}],"source":{"kind":"skill-catalog","form":"catalog","entries":[{"name":"office","description":"Create or edit Office files; inspect Office files and PDFs. Load before rendering, conversion, or recalculation to enable office_render, office_convert, and office_recalculate next step."},{"name":"office-docx","description":"Create, read, edit, and validate Word documents (.docx)."},{"name":"office-pptx","description":"Create, read, edit, and validate PowerPoint presentations (.pptx)."},{"name":"office-xlsx","description":"Read, create, edit, and validate Excel workbooks, data, and formulas (.xlsx)."}]},"role":"user","id":"{{sessionId}}"},"surfaceOp":"append"}}}
